DESCRIPTION:THRESHOLD 4 x 4 min\, 90 s easy jog between. Warm up 10 min\,
  cool down 10 min. Comfortably hard - three or four words at a time\, HR
  172-181 (LTHR measured 181 on the 7 Sep time trial - your easy runs sit
  at 161\, so anything under 170 is not a stimulus). Your first structure
 d interval session: threshold before VO2max because it recovers faster a
 nd you are two weeks into having a third run at all.\n\nWeek 9 of 17 - B
 uild\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nGUT TRAINING START
 S. Target 60-80 g carb/h by week 14\, from 40-50 now\, +10 g every two w
 eeks. No drop bags and no crew at Madeira - only ~2 checkpoints\, ~10 km
  apart - so you carry 400-500 g of carbohydrate yourself. Rehearse the w
 eight and the stowage\, not just the products. INTENSITY STARTS THIS WEE
 K\, on flat ground: Thursday's vertical stays STEADY because Hyrox is 8 
