 80-85% easy\, 15-20% hard. ORDER CHANGED 31 Aug - threshold Mon -> Tue\,
  legs Tue -> Wed\, easy run + push Wed -> Mon. Reason is measurement\, n
 ot fatigue: resting HR was 55 against a 50-52 baseline and HRV 78 agains
 t an 89 weekly average\, which distorts the HR-work relationship in both
