 p a TT wants - 9.6 h sleep and HRV 98 the night before)\, pull moved to 
 Tuesday as the recovery day\, legs to Wednesday\, easy 5 km to Friday\, 
 and Thursday's stairwell session replaced by casual football. Three runs
  held: TT\, Friday easy\, Saturday long. Push moved Wednesday -> Tuesday
 : Tuesday is now a single upper day and Wednesday is legs only. Easy run
  moved Friday -> Tuesday to sit directly after the time trial: hard/easy
  back to back for the train-low effect\, and it moves run #3 out of the 
 post-football Friday slot that has been the one getting skipped. Friday 
 is now empty\, which is the better setup for Saturday. Upper moved Tuesd
 ay -> Thursday morning: Tuesday is now the easy run alone\, and the uppe
 r session sits ~12 h before football on legs it does not touch. TIME TRI
