 ned at 4:09/km for 200 m. Baseline established: 5:15/km sustainable in 8
 -10 min blocks at HR 181-183\, LTHR 181\, form holds at 178-184 spm and 
 100-107 cm stride under duress. SUPERSEDED 8 Sep: retest set for Wednesd
