SUMMARY:Pull (upper)
DESCRIPTION:Pull (upper) - THURSDAY MORNING\, paired with push as a singl
 e upper day\, ~12 h before football. Different muscle groups entirely\, 
 so it costs the game nothing and the gym trip is the only one you make t
 hat day. HYROX SEEDING\, all substitutions not additions: (1) WARM UP ON
  THE SKIERG OR ROWER\, 5-8 min\, technique only - hinge and drive the fi
 rst third of the pull\, that is where 80% of ski power comes from. Repla
 ces your normal warm-up\, costs nothing. (2) SWAP one row variation for 
 a HEAVY FARMERS CARRY\, 4 x 40-60 m. Same pulling pattern\, direct Hyrox
  transfer. (3) Finish with DEAD HANGS\, 3 x max. Baseline 20 Aug was 32/
 36/31 s\, so 90 s by October was never realistic: target 55-60 s by 1 No
 v and 90 s by Hyrox in January. Grip takes 4-6 weeks to change and it is
  what limits the farmers carry. About 3 minutes total added to the sessi
