 05 / 5:17 / 5:28 / 5:14 / 5:12. Previous best 5 km was 29:15 on 15 Mar\,
  so a 36 s/km improvement. NOT a clean continuous 5 km: 81% of it sat at
  or above LTHR against 5% in the 1 Sep threshold session\, and it opened
  at 4:09/km for 200 m. Baseline established: 5:15/km sustainable in 8-10
  min blocks at HR 181-183\, LTHR 181\, form holds at 178-184 spm and 100
 -107 cm stride under duress. SUPERSEDED 8 Sep: retest set for Wednesday 
 16 September. Stream review showed the first 100 m ran at 3:50-4:00/km a
 nd 390 W with LTHR reached at 65 seconds\, so 7 Sep measured a pacing er
 ror rather than fitness - it is not a retest but the first properly exec
 uted attempt. Wednesday\, not Monday\, so it sits three days clear of th
 e Saturday long day instead of 40 hours. The 24 November trial in Hyrox 
 week 2 still stands as the fitness comparison. NOT A REAL DOWN WEEK IN P
 RACTICE: volume is down but intensity is not - a maximal time trial on M
