BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ultraxmadeira25k-w11-s1-benchmark@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260908T124212Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260916
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260917
SUMMARY:5 KM TIME TRIAL (5 km)
DESCRIPTION:5 KM TIME TRIAL - SECOND ATTEMPT. 7 Sep measured a pacing err
 or\, not fitness: the first 100 m went at 3:50-4:00/km and 390 W\, HR hi
 t LTHR 181 at 65 seconds\, and everything decayed from there. THE ONE RU
 LE: the first 400 m does not go under 5:10/km. If the watch shows a 4 in
  the opening two minutes the race is already gone. Warm up 20 min easy +
  4-6 strides finishing AT 5:15/km and NO faster. AUTO-PAUSE OFF. Out-and
 -back\, 2.5 km each way\, so wind cancels. Shirt off from the start. Tar
 get even 5:15-5:20/km throughout. If the shins burn\, SLOW DOWN 10-15 s/
 km - do not stop. A continuous 27:30 beats a broken 26:17 because paces 
 can be built from it.\n\nWeek 11 of 17 - Build\nTime trial week. Vertica
 l drops for one week only\; six more weeks of it remain. All three stren
 gth sessions kept - only the VO2max session goes\, replaced by the trial
 .\n46 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
