DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260915
SUMMARY:Push (upper)
DESCRIPTION:Push (upper) - after the easy run. Fresh\, not on legs you ju
 st destroyed.\n\nWeek 11 of 17 - Build\nTime trial week. Vertical drops 
 for one week only\; six more weeks of it remain. All three strength sess
 ions kept - only the VO2max session goes\, replaced by the trial.\n48 da
 ys to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
