BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ultraxmadeira25k-w11-s7-descent@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260908T124212Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260917
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260918
SUMMARY:▼ DESCENT LADDER (8 min)
DESCRIPTION:DESCENT LADDER - 8 min walking DOWN stairs with 5.6 kg in the
  pack\, lift back up. About 176 m of descent. THIS IS THE SESSION THE PL
 AN USED TO BE MISSING: Madeira is 2\,003 m DOWN as well as up\, and down
 hill running causes far more muscle damage and neuromuscular fatigue tha
 n level running at the same metabolic cost. One bout protects for weeks 
 (repeated-bout effect)\, which is why this is dosed weekly and progressi
 vely rather than repeated at 5 min. Stairs build tissue tolerance\; they
  do NOT reproduce running descent mechanics\, which is what the Posbank 
 long days are for.\n\nWeek 11 of 17 - Build\nTime trial week. Vertical d
 rops for one week only\; six more weeks of it remain. All three strength
  sessions kept - only the VO2max session goes\, replaced by the trial.\n
 45 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ultraxmadeira25k-w12-s0-cycling@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260908T124212Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260920
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260921
SUMMARY:○ OPTIONAL easy spin 45-60 min
DESCRIPTION:OPTIONAL easy spin 45-60 min - Sunday is now a REST day by de
 fault. Take the ride only if you feel good and Monday's run is easy. Wit
 h a quality session on Monday you need this rest more than you need the 
 ride.\n\nWeek 12 of 17 - Build\nBiggest vertical week so far\, ~2\,000-2
 \,300 m. HR is now unreliable as a guide: in mountain ultras heart rate 
 FALLS ~34 bpm across the race while RPE rises from 4.3 to 6.9. Pace off 
 knee-extensor RPE - how your quads feel - not the watch. PROGRESS METRIC
 : do not judge fitness off pace-at-HR inside the VO2max reps - 3 min is 
 too short for HR to settle and accumulated fatigue distorts it. Use a ST
 ANDARDISED EASY RUN instead: same route\, same target HR\, track the pac
 e month to month. That is the signal that replaces retesting until mid-N
 ovember.\n42 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ultraxmadeira25k-w12-s1-easy@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260908T124212Z
