SUMMARY:VO2MAX 6 x 3 min HARD\, 2 min jog (10 km)
DESCRIPTION:VO2MAX 6 x 3 min HARD\, 2 min jog. One more rep than week 12.
  Biggest running week of the block.\n\nWeek 14 of 17 - Peak\nKeep HR und
 er 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nTERRAIN WEEKEND #2 - POSBANK AGAIN\
 , not the Ardennes. Roughly EUR 30 of petrol against EUR 200\, and twent
 y reps of a 90-110 m climb is 1\,800 m of ascent AND hard-surface descen
 t - close to the whole race. Sustained descending on firm ground is the 
 one thing stairs cannot replicate\, and it is what decides your day. POL
 ES: bought 18-20 Sep\, so you have had three weeks on them by now. Use t
 hem the whole session. They cut RPE 14-18% and measurably reduce muscle 
 damage over a climb-and-descent day - but an inexperienced pole user in 
 a field study actually got SLOWER\, so the practice is the point. KIT-CH
 ECK HABIT STARTS HERE: every food item must be labelled with its calorie
  count\, and all disposable packaging must carry your bib number. Tape a
  strip on your gel flask reading contents and total kcal (e.g. '4x Upfro
 nt Gel PRO - 640 kcal'). Do it from this session on\, not at registratio
 n.\n27 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
