DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
SUMMARY:Push (upper)
DESCRIPTION:Push (upper) - after the easy run. Fresh\, not on legs you ju
 st destroyed.\n\nWeek 15 of 17 - Peak\nPEAK WEEKEND - Sat 17 Oct\, 15 da
 ys out. This is the overload the taper is built on\; the evidence favour
 s peaking 14-15 days out\, not five weeks. 3:45-4:00 and 1\,600-1\,800 m
 : roughly 60-70% of race duration but 80-90% of race vertical. Vertical 
 specificity is the lever\, not duration.\n18 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K
