 peaking 14-15 days out\, not five weeks. 3:45-4:00 and 1\,600-1\,800 m: 
 roughly 60-70% of race duration but 80-90% of race vertical. Vertical sp
 ecificity is the lever\, not duration.\n19 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
