 u feel fresh - feeling fresh is the taper working. PRESCRIBED IN MINUTES
 \, not kilometres: at 7:20/km your 5 km was 36 min\, and the accepted ea
 sy-run band is 30-75 min. Kilometres make the dose shrink as you get fas
 ter\, which is backwards.\n\nWeek 16 of 17 - Taper\nKeep HR under 158. W
 alk the climbs. Talk test.\nTaper starts. Volume down 45-55%\, intensity
  and frequency UNCHANGED - that combination is worth 2-3%\, about 7-11 m
 inutes on a 6-hour race. NOTHING ECCENTRIC AFTER 21 OCTOBER. Last heavy 
